# --- Trailing-slash normalisation. MUST STAY LAST: _redirects is first-match-wins,
# and every explicit slashed rule above needs to win over this catch-all.
#
# build.format:'file' means canonical URLs carry NO trailing slash. Workers Assets
# already normalises /path/ -> /path, but with a 307 (temporary), which Google
# consolidates link signals through far less reliably than a 301. The status is not
# configurable on that automatic redirect, so pre-empt it here with a real 301.
# `/` itself has only one slash and cannot match `/*/`, so the homepage is untouched.
/*/  /:splat  301
